WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Marisa uses raw Drive Rush to reach low-pressure range.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.100
Ryu blocks crouching LK.

3
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.350
Marisa backs away from Ryu’s recorded throw attempt.

4
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.800
Back HP punishes the missed throw.

5
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.800
